message: "Bitte so zitieren / Please cite as below."
type: dataset
title: "repairinfo open data: repairability and durability of electrical devices (EPREL, data.gouv.fr)"
abstract: >-
  Open data on the repairability and durability of electrical devices, prepared by repairinfo.app
  from the EU product database EPREL and the French repairability and durability indices published
  on data.gouv.fr: spare-part periods under EU ecodesign rules, product groups, rankings by the
  French indices, a smartphone register from EPREL and a cleaned GTIN extract of the French
  repairability index. Manufacturer declarations; no prices, no affiliate links, no personal data.
authors:
  - name: "repairinfo.app, MMR Labs GmbH"
    website: "https://www.repairinfo.app/"
